# Pairs with TenantRuleConfinement. CompiledTenantPartition re-validates each
# tenant rule because replication and restore write around the store; without
# it a foreign-tree or Telemetry tenant rule takes effect.
MODULE: CompileKeepsForeignArrival
TARGET: TenantRuleConfinement
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the snapshot compiler keeps a non-conforming tenant rule that arrived by replication or restore

--- FIND
CompileAdmits(r) == r.layer = "tenant" => TenantRuleShapeOk(r)
--- REPLACE
CompileAdmits(r) == TRUE
--- END
